s, background commands, MCP integration, and subagent support. Features interactive REPL sessions and one-shot run modes.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-31\",\n    \"category\": \"AI coding CLI\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Terminal-first coding agent for developers\",\n      \"Built for the part of AI coding that happens inside a real repository\",\n      \"Follows the core Claude Code experience while backing into any OpenAI-compatible model\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"ai.nvim\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/uuhan/ai.nvim\",\n    \"description\": \"A Neovim plugin for AI agent integration. Provides AI capabilities directly within the Neovim editor environment.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-06-04\",\n    \"category\": \"Neovim plugin\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Your final AI plugin for Neovim\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"rx-gui (Reasonix)\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/68110923/rx-gui\",\n    \"description\": \"JetBrains IDE AI Coding Assistant plugin (Reasonix GUI) featuring DeepSeek AI integration. Supports streaming conversations, Markdown rendering, code diff review, and cost tracking. Works across IntelliJ, PyCharm, and WebStorm.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-24\",\n    \"category\": \"JetBrains plugin\",\n    \"sources\": [\"GitHub\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"JetBrains IDE AI Coding Assistant with DeepSeek AI\",\n      \"Supports streaming conversations, Markdown rendering, code diff review, and cost tracking\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SigmaShake SSG\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/sigmashakeinc/vscode\",\n    \"description\": \"VS Code extension for AI governance, guardrails, audit, and .rules language support. Provides oversight and policy enforcement for Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini, and MCP assistants.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-25\",\n    \"category\": \"VS Code extension\",\n  