 class=\"item-description\">\n   667→                            Opus 4.8 & Dynamic Workflows Launch. Introduced Opus 4.8 with high-effort default, launched dynamic workflows orchestrating tens to hundreds of background agents.\n   668→                        </div>\n   669→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   670→                            <span>2026-05-28</span>\n   671→                        </div>\n   672→                    </div>\n   673→\n   674→                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n   675→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   676→                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.153\">Claude Code v2.1.153</a>\n   677→                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n   678→                        </div>\n   679→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   680→                            Enhanced Plugin Sources & Diagnostics. Added skipLfs option for GitHub/git plugin sources, added npm global install auto-update notice with /doctor diagnostics.\n   681→                        </div>\n   682→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   683→                            <span>2026-05-28</span>\n   684→                        </div>\n   685→                    </div>\n   686→\n   687→                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n   688→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   689→                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.152\">Claude Code v2.1.152</a>\n   690→                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n   691→                        </div>\n   692→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   693→                            Enhanced Code Review with Auto-Fix. Enhanced /code-review --fix to apply findings, renamed /simplify to /code-review, added disallowed-tools frontmatter.\n   694→           