    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-06-05</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 0;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 8px 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .header-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .header-title {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .header-date {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .nav-bar {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 8px 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-bar a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            margin-right: 15px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-bar a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        main {\n            padding: 0 12px 20px;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 6px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .product-item, .update-item, .insight-item {\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n        }\n\n        .product-item:last-child,\n        .update-item:last-child,\n        .insight-item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #444;\n            margin: 6px 0;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            display: -webkit-box;\n            -webkit-line-clamp: 3;\n            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin: 2px 2px 2px 0;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            color: #666;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #e8f5e9;\n            color: #2e7d32;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.bugfix {\n            background-color: #ffebee;\n            color: #c62828;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release {\n            background-color: #e3f2fd;\n            color: #1565c0;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #555;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin: 4px 0;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            border-left: 2px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .source-link {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-size: 11px;\n        }\n\n        .source-link:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 6px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 20px 12px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            margin: 0 8px;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .empty-section {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            padding: 20px 0;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .container {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            header {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n                border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;\n            }\n\n            .section-header {\n                border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;\n            }\n\n            a {\n                color: #000000 !important;\n                text-decoration: underline;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .stats-bar {\n            background-color: #fff;\n            padding: 8px 12px;\n            margin: 10px 0 20px;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .stat-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .stat-label {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .stat-value {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <div class=\"header-content\">\n                <div class=\"header-title\">Agent Code Daily - Agentic Coding Research Report</div>\n                <div class=\"header-date\">2026-06-05</div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <div class=\"nav-bar\">\n            <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a>\n            <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Whitelist Updates</a>\n            <a href=\"#technical-insights\">Technical Insights</a>\n            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code\">Claude Code</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <main>\n            <div class=\"stats-bar\">\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                    <span class=\"stat-label\">New Products:</span>\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\">15</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                    <span class=\"stat-label\">Updates:</span>\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\">12</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                    <span class=\"stat-label\">Insights:</span>\n                    <span class=\"stat-value\">3</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"three-column-layout\">\n                <section class=\"new-products\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-header\">New Products (15)</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/manan45/Cantus\">Cantus</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A Claude-first, local-first desktop coding environment for macOS (Apple Silicon). A native Tauri 2 app that pairs a Monaco editor with an integrated terminal running the Claude Code CLI.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">macOS</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Tauri 2</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-28</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\"The open-source IDE and GUI for Claude Code on macOS\"</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/tmdgusya/roach-code\">roach-code</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A config- and plugin-driven terminal AI coding agent supporting multiple models (DeepSeek, Codex/OpenAI, MiniMax, GLM). Multi-model rewrite distributed as a single static Go binary.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Multi-model</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Go</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\"An AI coding agent for your terminal\"</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/KangarooKi/Ultracode\">Ultracode</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A local AI-assisted coding CLI inspired by Claude Code. Runs agentic coding workflows with OpenAI-compatible models, function-calling tools, task planning, memory, permissions, hooks.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">OpenAI-compatible</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-31</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\"Terminal-first coding agent for developers\"</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/uuhan/ai.nvim\">ai.nvim</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A Neovim plugin for AI agent integration. Provides AI capabilities directly within the Neovim editor environment.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Neovim plugin</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI integration</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-06-04</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\"Your final AI plugin for Neovim\"</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/68110923/rx-gui\">rx-gui (Reasonix)</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            JetBrains IDE AI Coding Assistant plugin featuring DeepSeek AI integration. Supports streaming conversations, Markdown rendering, code diff review, and cost tracking.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">JetBrains plugin</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-24</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/sigmashakeinc/vscode\">SigmaShake SSG</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            VS Code extension for AI governance, guardrails, audit, and .rules language support. Provides oversight for Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini, and MCP assistants.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">VS Code extension</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI governance</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-25</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/MagWizD/alethia-clients\">alethia-clients</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            VSCode extension and JetBrains plugin for Aletheia that passively detects and attributes AI-generated code contributions by serializing flagged metadata as git notes.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI attribution tool</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">git notes</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-25</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/kavishsathia/inline\">inline</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Inline comments from an AI coding agent to your IDE. Designed for developers who prefer IDE integration over terminal-based AI coding agents or desktop apps.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">IDE integration</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Inline comments</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\"Inline comments from an AI coding agent to your IDE\"</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/Daaaaave/agentic-workspace-core\">agentic-workspace-core</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A portable repository-native foundation for agent memory, skills, handoffs, and knowledge workflows. Provides project-long memory and workspace management across AI coding sessions.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Project memory framework</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Agent handoffs</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/vikingmute/review-forge\">review-forge</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            An Agent Skill for structured, auditable code review workflows. Provides workflow-specific code review capabilities for AI coding agents.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Code review workflow</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Agent Skill</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/m-aboud/openclaw-devops-copilot\">openclaw-devops-copilot</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            DevOps Copilot: an AI-powered assistant for DevOps workflows, infrastructure as code generation, and SRE tasks. Helps orchestrate complex development operations workflows.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">DevOps workflow agent</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Infrastructure as code</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-06-01</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/kzoldyk/baton\">baton</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Desktop app for cross-agent AI handoffs. Pass project context, git diffs, and task states seamlessly between Codex, Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other AI coding agents.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Agent orchestration</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Cross-agent handoffs</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/tathagat22/plumb-mcp\">plumb-mcp</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A local Figma MCP server with no REST rate limits, no metered tool-call quotas. Drop-in alternative to Figma's Dev Mode MCP for Claude Code, Cursor, and Windsurf.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">MCP server</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Figma</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\"Local Figma MCP server - no REST rate limits, no metered tool-call quotas\"</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/XWJDream/MimoAgent\">MimoAgent</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            AI-powered coding assistant desktop app based on Xiaomi MiMo. Supports code generation, debugging, refactoring, project analysis, MCP tools, and TTS.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Desktop AI coding assistant</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Xiaomi MiMo</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"product-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/ntd4996/agentpet\">agentpet</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            A native macOS menu bar app with a desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI) in real time. Provides visual feedback for terminal-based AI coding workflows.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Desktop monitoring tool</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">macOS menu bar</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-31</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\"A desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents in real time\"</div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-header\">Whitelist Updates (12)</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.163\">Claude Code v2.1.163</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Enterprise Version Management & Enhanced Plugin Controls. Added version management for enterprise deployments, enhanced plugin management with /plugin list filters.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-06-04</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.162\">Claude Code v2.1.162</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Enhanced Agent CLI & Tool Specifications. Enhanced claude agents --json with waitingFor field showing session blockers, improved tool specification for Grep/Glob.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-06-03</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.161\">Claude Code v2.1.161</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            OpenTelemetry Integration & Enhanced MCP Management. OpenTelemetry integration with custom label support, improved claude agents UI with progress indicators.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.160\">Claude Code v2.1.160</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Safety Prompts for Config File Writes. Added safety prompts before writing to shell startup files and git config, enhanced acceptEdits mode.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.158\">Claude Code v2.1.158</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Auto Mode Support for Multiple Platforms. Extended Auto mode support to Bedrock, Vertex, and Foundry platforms for Opus 4.7 and 4.8 models.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.157\">Claude Code v2.1.157</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Automatic Plugin Loading & Enhanced Agent Commands. Automatic plugin loading from .claude/skills directories, added claude plugin init scaffolding command.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.156\">Claude Code v2.1.156</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Critical Opus 4.8 Thinking Block Fix. Fixed critical issue with Opus 4.8 where thinking blocks were being modified, causing API errors.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.154\">Claude Code v2.1.154</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Opus 4.8 & Dynamic Workflows Launch. Introduced Opus 4.8 with high-effort default, launched dynamic workflows orchestrating tens to hundreds of background agents.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.153\">Claude Code v2.1.153</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Enhanced Plugin Sources & Diagnostics. Added skipLfs option for GitHub/git plugin sources, added npm global install auto-update notice with /doctor diagnostics.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.152\">Claude Code v2.1.152</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Enhanced Code Review with Auto-Fix. Enhanced /code-review --fix to apply findings, renamed /simplify to /code-review, added disallowed-tools frontmatter.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-27</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.149\">Claude Code v2.1.149</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Enhanced Usage Analytics & Enterprise Settings. Enhanced /usage with per-category breakdown, improved /diff detail view with keyboard scrolling.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-22</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"update-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.148\">Claude Code v2.1.148</a>\n                            <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">bugfix</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Bash Tool Exit Code Fix. Fixed Bash tool returning exit code 127 on every command for some users (regression from v2.1.147).\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span>2026-05-22</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-header\">Technical Insights (3)</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://www.brethorsting.com/blog/2026/05/domain-expertise-has-always-been-the-real-moat/\">Domain expertise has always been the real moat</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Discussion on how domain expertise remains critical even with AI advances. The conversation touches on how AI coding tools and LLMs change (but don't eliminate) the value of deep technical knowledge.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">Aaron Brethorst</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">Hacker News</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">domain expertise</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">developer skills</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/announcements/series-b\">OpenRouter raises $113M Series B</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            OpenRouter, an AI model routing platform, raised $113M in Series B funding. This highlights continued investment in AI infrastructure and developer tooling for accessing multiple LLM APIs through unified interfaces.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">OpenRouter Team</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">Hacker News</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI infrastructure</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">LLM routing</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">funding</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://claude.ai/changelog\">Claude Opus 4.8 Launch and Dynamic Workflows</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Anthropic released Claude Opus 4.8 with improved performance and accuracy. Introduced dynamic workflows that adapt to task complexity. Enhanced terminal interaction with better command suggestions and multi-step execution support.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">Anthropic / Claude Team</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span class=\"source-link\">TechMedia</span>\n                            <span> • </span>\n                            <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Claude</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">agentic workflows</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <div>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code\">GitHub</a> |\n                <a href=\"https://claude.ai/changelog\">Changelog</a> |\n                <a href=\"https://docs.anthropic.com\">Documentation</a> |\n                <a href=\"https://support.anthropic.com\">Support</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n                Report generated by Agent Code Daily - Powered by Claude Agent SDK\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
