              A native macOS menu bar app with a desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI) in real time. Provides visual feedback and monitoring for terminal-based AI coding workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Desktop monitoring</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-31</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"A desktop pet that monitors your AI coding agents in real time\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/XWJDream/MimoAgent\" target=\"_blank\">MimoAgent</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI-powered coding assistant desktop app based on Xiaomi MiMo. Supports code generation, debugging, refactoring, project analysis, MCP tools, and TTS.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Desktop AI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Comprehensive AI coding assistance in a desktop app\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/Daaaaave/agentic-workspace-core\" target=\"_blank\">agentic-workspace-core</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        A portable repository-native foundation for agent memory, skills, handoffs, and knowledge workflows. Provides project-long memory and workspace management across AI coding sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Memory framework</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Knowledge workflows for AI agents\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/68110923/rx-gui\" target=\"_blank\">rx-gui (Reasonix)</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        JetBrains IDE AI Coding Assistant plugin featuring DeepSeek AI integration. Supports streaming conversations, Markdown rendering, code diff review, and cost tracking.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">JetBrains plugin</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"JetBrains IDE AI Coding Assistant with DeepSeek AI\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/vikingmute/review-forge\" target=\"_blank\">review-forge</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        An Agent Skill for structured, auditable code review workflows. Provides workflow-specific code review capabilities for AI coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">Code review</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Structured, auditable code review workflows\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\