Hub</span> · <span>2026-05-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Desktop app for cross-agent AI handoffs\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/kavishsathia/inline\" target=\"_blank\">inline</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Inline comments from an AI coding agent to your IDE. Designed for developers who prefer IDE integration over terminal-based AI coding agents or desktop apps.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">IDE integration</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span> · <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"For those who can't read off a terminal\"</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Whitelist Updates <span class=\"section-count\">11</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.163\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.163</span> Enterprise Version Management\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added version management controls for enterprise deployments, enhanced plugin management with /plugin list command supporting filters, improved /btw with clipboard copy shortcut, and enhanced hooks capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-04</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.162\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.162</span> Enhanced Agent CLI\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Enhanced claude agents --json with waitingFor field showing session blockers, improved tool specification for Grep/Glob on native builds, added /effort persistence confirmation, and enhanced slash command autocomplete behavior.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-03</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.161\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.161</span> OpenTelemetry Integration\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenTelemetry integration with custom label support via OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES, improved claude agents UI with progress indicators, enhanced /mcp connector management, and improved parallel tool call error handling.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.160\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.160</span> Safety Prompts\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added safety prompts before writing to shell startup files and git config, enhanced acceptEdits mode to prompt before build-tool config writes, improved Edit tool behavior after grep operations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-06-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.158\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.158</span> Auto Mode Expansion\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Extended Auto mode support to Bedrock, Vertex, and Foundry platforms for Opus 4.7 and 4.8 models via CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_AUTO_MODE=1 environment variable.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.157\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.157</span> Automatic Plugin Loading\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Automatic plugin loading from .claude/skills directories, added claude plugin init scaffolding command, enhanced plugin autocomplete, improved claude agents with settings.json support, and enhanced EnterWorktree switching capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.156\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.156</span> Critical Opus Fix\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Fixed critical issue with Opus 4.8 where thinking blocks were being modified, causing API errors.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category\">bugfix</span>\n                        <span>2026-05-29</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.154\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.154</span> Opus 4.8 Launch\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Introduced Opus 4.8 with high-effort default (/effort xhigh), launched dynamic workflows orchestrating tens to hundreds of background agents, reduced Fast mode cost to 2x standard rate for 2.5x speed.\n                    </div>\n   